</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Then this feast of feasts He ordered,</l><l>Feast of grace Divine;</l><l>Sacred symbols He appointed,</l><l>Bread and wine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thus His death of deaths is shadowed</l><l>In this simple way,</l><l>Looking backward, pointing upward,</l><l>To that day.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Till the morn of morns bright dawning,</l><l>Earth’s dark shadows passed;</l><l>And the splendor of God’s glory</l><l>Breaks at last.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thus the day of days shall open,</l><l>Deathless, cloudless, fair;</l><l>In that day, the Savior’s glories</l><l>We shall share!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
